{"nodes": [{"id": "_claude_agents_ux_writer_agent", "label": "Agente ux-writer (PO + UX writer pt-BR)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".claude/agents/ux-writer.md", "source_location": "frontmatter + corpo", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Existe porque o dono reclamou que textos 'parecem escritos por algu\u00e9m de TI'; entreg\u00e1vel \u00e9 copy pronta para colar, nunca s\u00f3 diretrizes."}, {"id": "_claude_agents_ux_writer_copy_invariants", "label": "Invariantes de copy do projeto", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/agents/ux-writer.md", "source_location": "\u26a0\ufe0f Contexto Cl\u00ednica Organizada", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Quebram silenciosamente se ignorados: UI sempre pt-BR, marca 'ConfirmaA\u00ed' aposentada em favor de 'Cl\u00ednica Organizada', placeholders {nome}/{data}/{hora}/{clinica} min\u00fasculos, instru\u00e7\u00e3o de resposta \u00e9 do sistema."}, {"id": "_claude_agents_ux_writer_terminology_by_segment", "label": "Terminologia por segmento (Paciente vs Cliente)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/agents/ux-writer.md", "source_location": "Invariantes de copy", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Em UI logada ler de useTerminology()/getTerminology() em vez de hardcodar; em p\u00e1ginas p\u00fablicas (sem sess\u00e3o) usar fraseado neutro ou 'paciente' como padr\u00e3o conservador. 'Segmento do neg\u00f3cio' \u00e9 o r\u00f3tulo correto, n\u00e3o 'ramo'."}, {"id": "_claude_agents_ux_writer_benefit_over_mechanism", "label": "Copy orientada a benef\u00edcio, n\u00e3o a mecanismo", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/agents/ux-writer.md", "source_location": "Princ\u00edpios de escrita", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Dizer o que a pessoa ganha, n\u00e3o